{
 "description": "Log decoding with sample.logdata (protocol.md \u00a76). For each case, scan the wire bytes, decode the frame, and compare level/file/line/text. Text must match exactly for these cases; other formatting is C-printf best effort. errors: decoding must fail with an error record of the given kind (\u00a77).",
